		annotation DisplayFolder = "Marketing Type Details"

		annotation 'Example Values' = "M01, M02, M03, M04, M05"

		annotation 'Common Questions' = "What is the marketing type code for Core? How many products are in each marketing type? Which marketing type has the highest promotional sales?"

